{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:ClimaxVolumeMass.QEnergy","@type":"LeanModule","name":"ClimaxVolumeMass.QEnergy","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":18,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.exists_nonneg_action","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.exists_nonneg_action","kind":"theorem","line":133,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L133-L136","doc":"**Q-Deformed Energy**: a rest-mass-nonnegative configuration exists. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.crossingEnergyNeg_lt_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.crossingEnergyNeg_lt_pos","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L122-L131","doc":"Positive crossings carry more energy than negative at `q > 1`.\n\nAn ordering statement, so `ℝ`: it is false over a generic field, which has\nno order to state it in. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.total_rest_real","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.total_rest_real","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L116-L120","doc":"The real q-energy at rest is its action — `total_rest` instantiated. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.qNumberReal_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.qNumberReal_zero","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L110-L114","doc":"`[0]_q = 0`, the hypothesis `total_rest` asks for, discharged at `ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.qNumberReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.qNumberReal","kind":"def","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L105-L108","doc":"The q-number `[n]_q = (qⁿ - q⁻ⁿ)/(q - q⁻¹)` at **real** exponents. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.total_rest","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.total_rest","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L86-L98","doc":"**At rest the q-energy is the action.** With `j = 0` the rotational term\ncarries `[0]_q = 0` and with `p_q = 0` the translational term vanishes,\nleaving `S_q`.\n\nThe only hypothesis is that the bracket kills `0`; no ordering, no\nexponentiation, no archimedean structure. Note the translational term needs\nno non-vanishing side condition on `[n]_q`, because `0 / x = 0` holds in any\n`DivisionRing` including at `x = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.total","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L78-L84","doc":"The total q-energy: rotational `[j]_q [j+1]_q ℏ_q`, translational\n`p_q² ℏ_q / (2 [n]_q)`, and the action `S_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.crossingEnergyNeg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.crossingEnergyNeg","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L74-L76","doc":"The crossing energy at a single negative crossing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.crossingEnergyPos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.crossingEnergyPos","kind":"def","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L70-L72","doc":"The crossing energy at a single positive crossing. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.hbarQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.hbarQ","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L63-L68","doc":"`ℏ_q = 1 - q⁻¹`, the quantum Planck constant, over any field.\n\nDistinct from the library's `QOU.Archimedean.hbarQ_q`, which is the *element*\n`1 - q_inv` of the Laurent ground ring rather than this function of `q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.S_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.S_q","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L57-L57","doc":"Categorical action `S_q` (rest-mass energy). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.n_strands","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.n_strands","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Number of strands in the braid representative. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.p_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.p_q","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L53-L53","doc":"q-momentum (writhe-derived). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.j","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.j","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Spin quantum number `j`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.q","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Substrate parameter. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.qNumber","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.qNumber","kind":"def","line":47,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L47-L47","doc":"The q-number `[·]_q` this instance is built over. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy.mk","kind":"ctor","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L45-L45","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.QEnergy","kind":"structure","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.lean#L40-L57","doc":"**q-Energy of a particle knot**: rotational + translational + rest mass.\n\nThe q-number is a *field* rather than a fixed function, which is what keeps\nthe structure generic — `total` below is the same expression whichever\nbracket the instance supplies. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:q-energy","label":"def:q-energy","md":"quantum-observable-universe/climax-volume-mass/q-energy.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}